<view class="page">
  <view class="eyebrow">共同的约定，温暖地遵守</view>
  <view class="title">我们的约定</view>
  <view class="card">
    <view>记录日常事实，共同确认，月底结算。发现错误时追加反向更正，保留原始记录和时间线。</view>
    <view class="hint">所有金额与积分以家庭协议及当前记录类型为准。</view>
    <button bindtap="open" data-format="pdf" disabled="{{busy}}" loading="{{busy}}">
      查看协议 PDF
    </button>
    <button class="secondary" bindtap="open" data-format="docx" disabled="{{busy}}">
      打开原始 Word 文件
    </button>
    <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view>
  </view>
</view>
